Package: wbR
Title: Spatial Water and Energy Balance Model
Version: 0.1.0.9000
Authors@R: c(
    person("James", "Johnston", role = "aut",
           comment = c(affiliation = "University of Oregon")),
    person("Andreas", "Wion", role = c("aut", "cre"),
           email = "drymixedconifer@gmail.com",
           comment = c(affiliation = "New Mexico Forest and Watershed Restoration Institute"))
    )
Description: Development interface for the v5.5 spatial water-balance engine,
    retaining the scientific model as an independently editable R source file.
    Supports optional in-simulation monthly zonal time series.
URL: https://github.com/drymixedconifer/wbR
BugReports: https://github.com/drymixedconifer/wbR/issues
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
Depends: R (>= 4.2.0)
Imports: terra, prism, Rcpp, RcppParallel
Suggests: testthat
SystemRequirements: C++11 toolchain for runtime Rcpp compilation
